  "problem": "The United States Declaration of Independence was ratified on July 4th, 1776. Given that January 1st, 1776, was a Monday, use congruences to determine on which day of the week the Declaration of Independence was ratified.\n\n*Hint: The year 1776 was a leap year since it's divisible by $4$ and is not an end-of-century year.*",
